---
skip_list:
  # We do not intend to publish any roles to Ansible Galaxy
  - 701  # No 'galaxy_info' found
  # We have over a thousand of these, won'tfix
  - fqcn-builtins  # Use FQCN for builtin actions.

# Ansible-lint will take into account the Ansible folder structure (i.e. vars, handlers dirs)
# ... and override all uncategorised yaml files as playbooks - see config.py and utils.py
# ... See: https://github.com/ansible-community/ansible-lint/issues/1398
# ... and https://ansible-lint.readthedocs.io/en/latest/usage.html#linting-playbooks-and-roles
# TODO: Along removing lint checks above, check if there's a way to a) replace find, b) somehow parse our dir structure
#
kinds:
  - vars: "**/files/*.{yaml,yml}"
